{"slug":"lab-boolean-check","kind":"lab","title":"Boolean Check","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T02:55:17.230Z","items":[{"kind":"challenge","id":"a77dbc43c33f39daa4429b4f","title":"Build a Boolean Check Function","challengeType":26,"demoType":null,"description":"In this lab, you will build a function that checks if a value is classified as a boolean primitive.\n\nBoolean primitives are `true` and `false`.\n\n**Objective:** Fulfill the user stories below and get all the tests to pass to complete the lab.\n\n**User Stories:**\n\n1. You should have a function called `booWho` that receives one argument.\n1. If the argument received is a boolean primitive, the function should return `true`.\n1. If the argument is any other value, the function should return `false`.","hints":[{"text":"You should have a `booWho` function.","test":"assert.isFunction(booWho);"},{"text":"`booWho(true)` should return `true`.","test":"assert.isTrue(booWho(true));"},{"text":"`booWho(false)` should return `true`.","test":"assert.isTrue(booWho(false));"},{"text":"`booWho([1, 2, 3])` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho([1, 2, 3]));"},{"text":"`booWho([].slice)` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho([].slice));"},{"text":"`booWho({ \"a\": 1 })` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho({ a: 1 }));"},{"text":"`booWho(1)` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho(1));"},{"text":"`booWho(NaN)` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho(NaN));"},{"text":"`booWho(\"a\")` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho('a'));"},{"text":"`booWho(\"true\")` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho('true'));"},{"text":"`booWho(\"false\")` should return `false`.","test":"assert.isFalse(booWho('false'));"}],"seed":"","seedLang":"js","region":null,"solution":"function booWho(bool) {\n  return typeof bool === 'boolean';\n}","solutionLang":"js","beforeAll":"","beforeEach":""}]}